{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1517873-songs-for-the-dead-mtaw2e-ic","id":1517873,"title":"Songs for the Dead [MTAW2E IC]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-13T06:55:35-07:00","id":1517873,"title":"Songs for the Dead [MTAW2E IC]","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u>Cold Open</u></span><br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Tristan da Cu</span>nha: Isla</b><br /> <br /> <i>Full fathom five thy father lies;<br /> Of his bones are coral made;<br /> Those are pearls that were his eyes:<br /> Nothing of him that doth fade,<br /> But doth suffer a sea-change<br /> Into something rich and strange.<br /> Sea-nymphs hourly ring his knell:<br /> Ding-dong.<br /> Hark! now I hear them,\u2014ding-dong, bell.</i><br /> <br /> -William Shakespeare, from <i>The Tempest</i><br /> <br /> <br /> Isla came into her fathers room with a mug of milk tea. Her skin was about the same color, and her young face was framed by long, dark, tight curls that seemed to form a halo all around. She set the mug of tea on his night stand.<br /> He wasn\u2019t moving. His body wasn\u2019t going up and down under the covers the way it usually did while he slept.<br /> <br /> \u201cDa?\u201d<br /> <br /> She knelt down by his bed and tried to shake him. He did not stir. She held her face close to his lips and nostrils, trying to feel even the faintest breath. His skin felt cold. He was cold. His hands clutched a small photograph in a frame: a picture of her mother when she was young. She wept, sea salt tears streaming down her face.<br /> <br /> The small Anglican church on the Island of Tristan da Cunha was more or less full. Isla\u2019s father had been well liked, even though a strangeness had hung about him that many in the small community did not understand. He had come from off the island, no one could say where, and swept that young woman off her feet. And then the child. And the wife had died. But he stayed on the Island, with the little girl.<br /> <br /> She looked at the coffin where he laid. Briars and roses intertwined in a bouquet on top of the casket. Her father\u2019s hand still clutched the photograph.<br /> <br /> Across the aisle the MacAedan boys sat silently in their best clothes. The youngest one, Artuir, 17, about her age, looked over at her. And then quickly popped his head into line with his brothers when she returned his gaze.<br /> <br /> That night she went to the cemetery. She tried to be silent and not be seen by anyone. She approached her father\u2019s grave. It had a headstone and border around the plot made by white painted bricks. Beside his was her mother\u2019s headstone. She bent down and kissed it. She took the shovel that she brought with her and planted it in with her foot. The words of the funeral rang in her ears<br /> <br /> <i>May God our Father forgive us our sins and bring us to the eternal joy of his kingdom,<br /> where dust and ashes have no dominion.</i><br /> <br /> She looked out at the green field surrounding the cemetery, and she could hear the ocean waves.<br /> <br /> <i>He makes me lie down in green pastures and leads me beside still waters.</i><br /> <br /> It took some time, but eventually she hit coffin. She cleared enough dirt away to open the lid. With all her strength, and several tries, she lifted her father out of the grave and placed him in a body bag. Then she filled the grave back in. They would be planting flowers soon.<br /> <br /> The graveyard was surrounded by a low wall made of rough unmortared stones, near the sea shore. Isla put the bag in a small cart and pulled it down towards the beach.<br /> <br /> She took the body of her father out of the bag, removed the clothes, and dragged it along the beach till she reached the waves.<br /> <br /> <i>Naked came I out of my mother's womb, and naked shall I return thither: the Lord gave, and the Lord hath taken away; blessed be the name of the Lord.</i><br /> <br /> She removed her own clothes to the skin. She took hers and her fathers clothes and stowed them in the cart. She retraced her steps, careful that there were no tracks leading to the water.<br /> <br /> She began to swim out into the waves, continuing to drag the body with her into the sea.<br /> <br /> <i>Behold, I tell you a mystery: We shall not all sleep, but we shall all be changed\u2014 in a moment, in the twinkling of an eye\u2026</i><br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-18T15:52:49-07:00","id":1518271,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">12:47 am Sydney, Australia</span></b><br /> <br /> \u200b<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Katab</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Despite the seasonably cool weather, many had chosen to stay inside tonight. Perhaps it was the grumbling sky, perhaps it had been a long work day for most. The usual hustle and bustle had quickly died down, and only a few cars now drove past a small caf\u00e9. Inside, a somewhat rough figure sits, sipping on some hot tea, and regarding the park just across the street. They wear a slightly worn and stained waterproof jacket and pants, cutting a sharp contrast between the soft wood design of the store. Presently, an employee come up to them, seemingly hoping for an early night.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u201cUh, I\u2019m sorry, but the store is about to close.\u201d</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">The figure takes a moment and nods to the employee. They finish their drink and look around for a moment before rising.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><i>\u201cAlright, last check. Wallet? Check. Key? Check. Passport and id? Check. Payment? Yep, still whole and full. Are the enchantments on my stuff still holding?...it\u2019s been like a week, I\u2019m sure they haven\u2019t they gone bad yet. They\u2019ll hold for another night. Probably. Phone? No mail. Should just be the night guards by now. Guess it\u2019s go time.\u201d</i></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">The figure gets up and exits, turning towards the ally just next to the caf\u00e9. They furtively look back and forth before entering, pulling out a small 12-sided coin and look downward at the sidewalk. They begin to focus on an old memory, of a shadowy gate. They roll the coin in-between their fingers for a moment, before flicking it onto the street. As they do so, the imaginary gate opens, and before them appears a discoloration appears, as if the world before them was rendered into a grainy photograph. They regard it for a moment before striding forward, and into the discoloration. They seem to vanish from the ally, and the discoloration stands seemingly alone for a moment before vanishing as suddenly as it appeared.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-18T15:59:19-07:00","id":1518273,"title":"","content":"<b>\u200b1:12 am, Sydney, Australia\u200b<br /> <br /> Katab</b><br /> <br /> Katab looks back out from the alley towards the park. The world around seems much dimmer than before, like a desaturated photo. Mist covers the ground around them, lightly obscuring their feet. The buildings and cars have become slight see-through. They begin striding towards their destination, across the street with little regard for the see-through cars. They spot a muttering figure through the mist that seemed to be all too physical, whom they carefully avoid. Even without checking, several such figures were all around. The park, from Katab\u2019s Twilit perspective, seemed ominous. It seemed to Katab that there was much motion just out of their sight. They simply hurry their pace.<br /> <br /> After a few minutes, they made it out of the park, standing before a building of glass and stone, much more substantial that its surroundings. Letters and the building\u2019s logo pronounced it to be the Australian Museum as if it was the only one with a claim to that title. Katab shakes their head, not for the first time, and eyes the glass doors. They were quite as solid as the rest of the building, even to this state of Twilight, perhaps due to the Gate residing inside the building. Katab sighed and made their way to the far back of the building. There was an employee-only door, leading to the various offices that formed the back part of the museum. Katab pulled out a small key, shaped out of ephemera to perfectly fit the lock of the back door. However, they hesitated before unlocking the door. One of the nightly security guards was illuminated just beyond the door, sitting in a small nook, reading a magazine. Katab looks at a light directly behind guard and aims a finger gun at it. A moment later, the light flickers and goes out. The guard starts, and turn to examine the light. Katab quickly and quietly unlocks the door, before slipping inside, and relocking it. The guard shakes his head at the light, before returning to his magazine, seemingly none the wiser.\u200b<br /> <br /> Katab quickly made their way up to the second floor, passing several unaware security guards on their way up. They quickly spotted what they were looking for, an exhibit simply titled Dinosaurs. Achient stone and bone litter the exhibit, some sealed in glass containers, while others are exposed to air and the public. Katab takes a moment to admire the persevered bone before looking up and down the various aisle. They search around for any security guards who may be lingering in the exhibit. After determining the area to be clear, they make their way to a particular Tyrannosaurus skull, far bigger than any of the old bones. The mouth of the great predator was big enough to comfortably swallow a person whole. Dark stains cover large sections of its teeth, giving off the uncomfortable impression the skull had just eaten a meal. Katab makes one last check that nobody is around and presses the ephemeral key against the skull. The bones creak for a moment, before opening wide to reveal\u2026another set of exhibits beyond, much like the room Katab was currently in. Katab shudders a little, but passes through the open maw into the room beyond.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-18T16:41:51-07:00","id":1518275,"title":"","content":"<b>????, </b><b>The Upper Reaches</b><br /> \u200b<br /> <br /> The room beyond is cold, and the bones drip with condensation. The wall seems to press inward, and many of the displays are scattered about, put into alien shapes. Katab tries not to think about how closely the bones resemble the neverborn things that pull themselves out of the rivers.. They turn to look outside of the exhibit hall. The museum is gloomy, with what little light there is coming from the lighting of various displays. Katab descents the to lower floors. 4 floors later they stand outside what appears to be the door to the museum director's office. Katab reaches up and knocks. After a moment, a scraping sound comes from inside the room, and the door opens to reveal a desk and a couple of chairs. They take a moment to regard the specter across from them. The spook was of average height, one rendered ragged from the years below. His face was gaunt, and his head was twisted unautually to one side, still wearing the rope that killed him. His ice-blue eyes were still sharp though, flicking back and forth between Katab and the closed door behind them.<br /> <br /> \u201cHey Brady, heard to had something for me?\u201d<br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-20T11:24:14-07:00","id":1518364,"title":"","content":"<i>This bleeder again. Never lets up.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;You're a long way from gaff chiseler og'. Ain't there any wissers in Sydney for them to send? Or you just like to stretch ye legs. Osh, No matter. Yes. We got a nixer for ye. In kind for all the trinkets we've been upturning for ye.&quot; Brady said in a rough, Irish sounding accent. He'd been dead since Kelly had been robbing. A wild colonial boy. &quot;There's a killer on the loose. Some strange doings. Cuts people up bad. Over in Singapore, I hear...&quot;<br /> <br /> A cell phone ringtone starts to go off. Brady gives Katab the strangest look, like a confused dog.<br /> <br /> &quot;eh...you going to get that mate?&quot;<br /> <br /> Katab gingerly picks up the phone, like it might be diseased.<br /> <br /> &quot;Chi kati. Katab! What's happening?&quot; Its Davenant. &quot;So... your little present. Another one has turned up. In Argentina of all places. Where are you now?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-21T00:12:11-07:00","id":1518417,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;What, how did...I'm in the the Underworld, for crying out loud. Christ, this must be Urgent.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Katab frowns at the phone as they start to get a sinking feeling.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, just browsing a Mom and Pop Shop. Was thinking of maybe picking up some bits. You know, it's always good to support local businesses.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Present? I don't think I've made any contributions to Argentina...what would any of my rescues be doing there?...Something is off&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Argentina, huh? Don't recall ever paying a visit. You sure it's one of mine?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-21T12:37:43-07:00","id":1518444,"title":"","content":"&quot;No, no. Not something you found. But there are apparently multiple copies of the mundane book that the Abyssal Grimoire was made from. And one of the consila down there is having some sort of trouble with a cult or something. I think you should take back up. I want you to make contact with a Talon in San Francisco who knows Metros. Gawain. NIce chap, big sword. He has some experience with &quot;intruders&quot;, and is doing some really interesting stuff with Arthur and Camelot research-wise. I'd like to talk to him more after this is all over.&quot; <br /> <br /> Brady raises an eyebrow at the &quot;Mom and Pop shop&quot; comment. He begins to look bored as Davenant goes on.<br /> <br /> <i>Warmies...No focus on what's at hand.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-21T17:36:47-07:00","id":1518466,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>Oh, freaking hell. Of course, it's that dammed tome. Would have saved me a lotta trouble if I had just tossed it back into the drink.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;</i>Oh, *that* piece. Had been hoping I would have heard the last of it by now.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Copies of the original? The Castoff alone nearly started a war between the Domains. Not to mention what it did to those who read it. If multiple copies showed up, well, I can see why they might want my experience...No way the Guardians aren't involved. Never did hear that they caught the Author. Might still be running loose. And I bet the Guardians are getting a bit twitchy by now.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;</i>Yeah ok. I'll catch the first flight over there. Just send me the guy's info. I'll keep you posted.&quot;<br /> <br /> Katab hangs up, and look apologetically at Bradly.<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyways, where were we?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-24T06:50:27-07:00","id":1518697,"title":"","content":"<b>Bell Family Farm, Marin County, California, USA</b><br /> <br /> Nadeshiko Bell was in the shed preparing an arrangement of flowers. She was a skilled disciple of <i>Ikebana</i>, and focused on traditional designs. There was nothing traditional about this arrangement, but the girls had insisted. She had constructed a <i>hanawa</i> of yellow chrysanthemums and lilies.<br /> <br /> She looked out the door of the shed into a grassy field and the rows of flowers beyond. It was summertime, and the summer flowers were in bloom filling the air with sweet fragrance. There was a faint breeze and she could also smell the sea. The summers were cooler here than in Osaka. Over on the other side of the yard was the farm house, and the two little girls Keiko and Rei sat in their best dresses on the porch looking solemnly at a cardboard box, their little legs dangling off the porch swing.<br /> <br /> A little farther off , under an old tree, was her husband, Clint, and an old family friend, Richard, one of Clint's former <i>kendo</i> students. They were digging a hole big enough for the cardboard box and discussing something. Nadeshiko felt her anxiety quicken. She knew it had nothing to do with this sad day, but was some sort of mission that Clint was sending Richard on, filled with their secret names for things. She respected her husband and understood that his work was important, but she did not like these &quot;missions&quot;. She thought about her father, the Air Defense General back in Japan. And her sister Patricia, traveling all over the world as a reporter. This reminded her of what she had been dreading. She needed to call Torisshuchan and tell her the bad news about Michi her cat, who had been with Trish since she was a girl and whom she had left here at the farm when she went to Europe.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> &quot;The Order needs you to go South America. Buenos Aires. There is a young Mystagog who needs our assistance with a dangerous Scelesti. They will be arriving at the airport here in San Francisco and you can meet them there.&quot; Caliburn said in his slow and deliberate way as he pushed his shovel into the earth near the tree. The hole needed to be deep enough for the cat's box. The Ronin Enchanter looked over across the field to his wife standing in the door of the potting shed. He was follower of the path of Time and Fate, not Mind, but he could tell from her eyes what she was contemplating. He turned back to Gawain. &quot;Any questions?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T15:37:21-07:00","id":1519128,"title":"","content":"<b>Paris, France, just before Midnight</b><br /> <br /> &quot;I need to speak with you when you are able&quot; said the text from Nadeshiko on Trish's phone. Trish Takehashi was on the train, in the quiet section, ridding from Istanbul to Paris. She had had quiet the adventure while she was in Istanbul and she was still trying to figure out how to describe some of it to her newspaper readers. High Tech corporate espionage and hackers that seemed to be able to hack even the laws of physics. How did she always end up in these situations?<br /> <br /> She got up to go to the Nonquiet section of the train. She was dressed in dark raw denim jeans, a tweed jacket, and sensible shoes for traveling. She pulled her dark, wavy black hair from her eyes . She made her way there and dialed Nadeshiko. She looked at her watch. Still afternoon there. &quot;Konnichiwa Oneesan&quot;.<br /> <br /> The sky outside the window began to darken as Trish's older sister told her the news about her cat, Michi. He had been a very brave cat, and had even helped her to defeat some unusually aggressive spiders back when she lived in London. &quot;I'm glad the girls are taking it so well, and that Clint's student was able to help out. He seems like a good friend,&quot; she said continuing in Japanese. &quot;It is very sad. Shikata ga nai.&quot; Trish looked out the window as she disconnected the call. It had begun to rain, and drops were streaking down the glass. A few tears ran down her cheek as well. This always seemed to happen. Like the sky knew what she was feeling. Just luck she guessed.<br /> <br /> She went back to her seat in the quiet section. There, sitting across from her seat was a little girl. She was dressed oddly, in old fashioned clothes. As Trish sat down, she felt like that part of the train had gotten colder. The little girl coughed. She looked at the girls eyes. They seemed as sad as hers had been. They were feeling twins.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> Trish and the little girl, whom she had learned spoke German, got off the train when it arrived in Paris. As they went to go get Trish's luggage they saw a tall man with blond hair holding a sign that said &quot;Trish Takehashi&quot;. He seemed a little lost, as if uncertain what he was doing. Trish took an instant liking to the man. And not just because he was tall and she had always felt a little subconscious about her own height growing up in Japan. He seemed, despite his overwhelmed and bewildered look, to have a very trustworthy face and Trish had a sense of these things, who to trust and who not to. He also, as she gave him a closer look, to have an oddness about him. Like little sparkles that seemed to dance about him. She had seen this a few times before, and it forebode some interesting times ahead.<br /> <br /> The little girl, Rahel, began a coughing fit. Trish got a cough drop from her bag and handed it to the child. It seemed to pass through her hand and drop to the floor. &quot;Oops. Clumsy of me, &quot; Trish said in German. She tried to give Rahel another one, but the same thing happened and she gave up.<br /> <br /> She and Rahel approached the tall, blond man. &quot;Bonsoir monsieur. Je m'appelle Trish Takehashi, la journaliste. Ca va?&quot; And stuck out her hand American style.<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-30T19:59:52-07:00","id":1519217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CalvinSiler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1517873-songs-for-the-dead-mtaw2e-ic?p=1518697#post1518697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Bell Family Farm, Marin County, California, USA</b><br /> <br /> &quot;The Order needs you to go South America. Buenos Aires. There is a young Mystagog who needs our assistance with a dangerous Scelesti. They will be arriving at the airport here in San Francisco and you can meet them there.&quot; Caliburn said in his slow and deliberate way as he pushed his shovel into the earth near the tree. The hole needed to be deep enough for the cat's box. The Ronin Enchanter looked over across the field to his wife standing in the door of the potting shed. He was follower of the path of Time and Fate, not Mind, but he could tell from her eyes what she was contemplating. He turned back to Gawain. &quot;Any questions?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;What kind of help? Is this mere bodyguard work or am I going hunting? How is the Mystagogue caught up in all this?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-31T04:54:49-07:00","id":1519239,"title":"","content":"&quot;What is that to you Talon?&quot; Caliburn said calmly but firmly, &quot;Adaptability is strength. Serivice is mastery.&quot;<br /> <br /> He paused. Then he shoveled another load of dirt. For a brief moment he seemed to show some emotion, but then restrained himself.<br /> <br /> &quot;I knew many mystagogues who died because they did not have our help.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;I do not know the exact nature of the threat,&quot; he looked up at the sky and then back down to the earth, &quot;That is for you to discover. Be prepared.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-31T05:27:40-07:00","id":1519242,"title":"","content":"&quot;What is that to you Talon?&quot; Caliburn said calmly but firmly, &quot;Adaptability is strength. Serivice is mastery.&quot;<br /> <br /> He paused. Then he shoveled another load of dirt. For a brief moment he seemed to show some emotion, but then restrained himself.<br /> <br /> &quot;I knew many mystagogues who died because they did not have our help.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;I do not know the exact nature of the threat,&quot; he looked up at the sky and then back down to the earth, &quot;That is for you to discover. Be prepared.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-31T05:54:14-07:00","id":1519244,"title":"","content":"&quot;This willworker is young. The Mysterium once knew that the Lie was alive, but now they have forgotten this and greedily gobble mysteries, heedless of the opposition that is the power of Magic. The mage is initiated into their &quot;Egregore&quot;. They do not think of the self as whole as we do. They view all of their members as being a part of the same body. I do not sit in judgement on their order's doctrines. We have our duty. Remember to first gain mastery of yourself.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The mystagogue's name is Katab. They may know more about the exact nature of the abyssal threat. Keep your senses sharp and learn what you can. Remember that the deep ones of chaos sing a seductive song.&quot; He paused.<br /> <br /> &quot;And beware of the Seers. They held the upper hand till recently in Buenos Aires. Look for hidden thrones.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-03T16:53:34-07:00","id":1519679,"title":"","content":"<b>Gilad</b><br /> <br /> Gilad made his way through the streets of Paris, slowly taking in the illuminated buildings and the buzz of night life. The night was a bit colder than usual, but nothing he couldn't handle. He was wearing a gray shirt and a brown leather jacket, a brown belt and some jeans. Reasonable enough for a bard, but durable for Arrow work, although he often wondered what kind of grudge inspired the design of those pockets.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I think that is the Saint Chapelle, I might have gone too far&quot;</i><br /> <br /> He took some hand drawn directions out of his pocket and studied them for a moment, seemed he was still on the right track. He checked his watch, and hastened his pace. He arrived at the Gare Est Train station, pausing from a second to contemplate it from the entrance plaza. A structure the size of a palace, built to withstand countless winters, emitting an inner light that defied the lethargy of night. Inside, domes of glass shielded from the rain and made the sky itself into the ceiling mural. Day or night, countless good for sale filled the shelves. He made his way through it all.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Sometimes I think these cosmic tyrants have been using lathunds, you could never build this if they didn't&quot;</i><br /> <br /> He made his way to the station's map and looked for the correct terminal, making his way there. He arrived just in time, but it seemed the train had yet to arrive. He took the opportunity to buy a beer and find a place to sit while waiting, enjoying people watching for a while. He heard many languages and sounds, sometimes the occasional Swedish, which brought a smile to his face. This was a good place to visit, especially when he missed the sounds of home.<br /> <br /> The train pulled into the station, a colossal snake of iron and glass, moving faster than the greatest horse. He made his way to the disembarking point and lifted the sign with Trish's name. Suddenly Gilad heard the sound of a willow flute, the sylvan tune he heard in his \u00c5rsg\u00e5ng clear as day. He listened more attentively, no longer focusing on the melody, but on the intent, the heartbeat, opening all his senses to the indescribable meaning only it can convey. Waves of sound gained color, then forming as his eyes adjusted. Searching around, he saw a woman accompanied by a little girl humming with the song of the dead. She saw her speak to her, untroubled by the Sleepers nearby.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;She can see ghosts ?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Before he could think further on it, the woman noticed him and made her way over. Before she could say anything, the little girl started coughing and the woman offered her some type of...medicinal pellets ? Whatever the case, it phased through the ghost and fell on the floor, but the woman didn't seem to acknowledge the fact.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;She can see them, but doesn't know they are depart...&quot;</i> She started speaking something in French, Gilad had no idea what it all meant, he heard Trish Takenashi somewhere in there.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Okay, its the right person. They told me she can speak Swedish, lets just hope for the best&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Hej, miss Takenashi and companion. I am Erik Andersen from Utopia, welcome to the City of Lights !&quot; He turned his attention to the fallen medicine, then to the ghost and back to Trish &quot;I'm afraid its too late for the medicine to work, your friend has already tossed the spoon in the corner.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-04T11:46:08-07:00","id":1519776,"title":"","content":"Trish blushed a little, but tried to hide it. <i>Oh, of course. Swedish. What was I thinking? And so polite. And something of a poet. He's the new band member. Flute, I think? </i><br /> <br /> She had been listening to a playlist of Utopia's latest music to familiarize herself with their work. The Swedish music scene was so fascinating right now. And it was a welcome escape from all the strange things that had happened to her the past few years. Motorcycle gangs, Yakuza, terrorists, secret societies, UFO truthers, and so on. She was looking forward to writing a story about something that seemed completely safe and not dangerous at all.<br /> <br /> Then she winced a little at the name mistake. It brought up painful memories of her girlhood. Being bullied and teased for her mixed parentage - a Japanese father and American mother. Gaijin. <i>Takenashi. 'T</i><i>all tree'. Deru kugi wa utareru. </i><br /> <br /> &quot;Ta Ke Ha Shi&quot; she said, emphasizing each syllable distinctly. <i>Am I being rude, correcting him? He is Swedish. He won't mind. </i>&quot;I think there is a Takenashi who writes manga. Takehashi means 'high bridge'. It is a very normal, common name in Japan.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>...already tossed the spoon in the corner? Hmm, its an idiom. The best thing with Swedes is just to be as direct as they are.</i>\u200b<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't think little Rahel here has given up on anything. She is quite insistent on getting to her parents at the Gare du Nord. She says they are going by train to Calais to get on a ship to America. I don't know why they aren't taking a plane. It is all a little strange. And she is so young to be traveling alone. Don't you think we should help?&quot;<br /> <br /> Trish did not wait for Erik to respond, but began walking with long strides to the exit of the station with her luggage rolling behind her. &quot;Come along, Schatzilein. Let's find mami and papa&quot; she said in German to the little girl. The girl gave another little cough, and as she passed Erik, following after Trish, he noticed a slight smell of bitter almond.<br /> <br /> Outside the station, Erik saw Trish and Rahel waiting by the street. A car pulled up quickly. Jorunn was driving. And another person that he didn't recognize was in the front passenger seat. Jorunn rolled down his window and leaned over.<br /> <br /> &quot;Get in idiot! You're being followed,&quot; she said in Norwegian.<br /> <br /> Trish turned to look at Erik with a questioning look.<br /> <br /> <i>Chikusho! Here we go again...</i><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-04T19:28:32-07:00","id":1519821,"title":"","content":"Gilad's mind races.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;So we're making a hen out of a feather. Hope you stored some ghostly power kid, chances are we are driving away from your Anchor&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;She's a friend, we have to go&quot; He rushes them towards the back seat and quickly enters after them &quot;Go, go !&quot;.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Now to give Jorunn a bit more context, not sure if her friend is a Sleeper&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Any idea who they are, or just some random <u>[coughing ghost in the back seat]</u> ?&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Thank Mimir she understands High Speech. Hope she reads between the lines that I have The Sight up and tells me if our stalker is mundane or not&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 08-04-2023, 10:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-08T05:57:20-07:00","id":1520098,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Roving Eye. Following this one since Munich,&quot; Jorunn said, glaring at Trish through the rear view mirror. &quot;This is Arjuani by the way. He is a metropolitan.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Hello,&quot; said the man in the front passenger seat turning around to look at the back seat. He was a Levantine man in his early forties with thinning hair and kind eyes. He looked at the little girl.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah! You found Rahel. Yes, it is that time of year. Like clockwork, for eighty-seven years.&quot;<br /> <br /> He spoke in German to the girl ,&quot;Don't worry, We will get you to mami and papa&quot;. Then to Jorunn in broken English, &quot;We need to get to Gare du Nord before One. That's where her anchor is.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Hold on!&quot; Jorunn ran through the traffic light, swerving to avoid oncoming cars. &quot;Gilad. Make yourself useful. [Sleepwalker idiot won't even notice. Stupid Cow]&quot;<br /> <br /> Arjuani looked over at Trish, seemingly unaffected by the hijinks. &quot;Are you well, Mademoiselle? This one usually attaches herself to grieving or homesick passengers,&quot; he said in French.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm think I am a little confused,&quot; Trish replied, &quot;This girl is seven or eight at the most. Are you saying she has been coming to Paris every year for the past eighty-seven years?,&quot; and then in Norwegian, &quot;And who is following us? Government agents?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Mongo j\u00e6vla fitte!&quot; said Jorunn as she made sharp turn onto a side street. Trish and Gilad jostled about in the back seat, partially phasing through Rahal sitting in between them. Rahel began to cry, and frost started to cloud the windows. The bitter almond smell became more intense. &quot;Forbanna hestkuk!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I think my Norwegian is not very good. I misunderstood,&quot; said Trish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-10T17:53:57-07:00","id":1520346,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;So these are Panopticon agents, let's make them hang up their gloves&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Gilad starts focusing at the car chasing them, beginning to form an Imago, arranging high speech runes to create the sheet music for a dirge. As it starts to form and the melody begins playing, he moves the palm of his hand up, with the thumbs of his fingers held together. The music stops, the sheet music melts and immediately reforms into a rushlight in his hand, a grey flame atop it. He focuses on the story of <i>Godfather Death</i>, who held the light of his godson's life in his hands. The godson who had abused his kindness, the one who was twice an oathbreaker. He focuses on it as if he was the godfather himself and the light diminishes under his withering stare, causing the wheel of the car to go bald. He turns over his hand and lets go of it, the light fading into nothing, the tire gaining a flat.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;That should buy us some time, no way to fix that quickly with Sleepers watching. Jorunn mentioned Arjuani is a metropolitan, the city walkers ? I wonder how he is connected with Rahel.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;They must be driving with their thumbs in the middle of their palms, they just got a flat&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 08-11-2023, 12:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-11T15:24:20-07:00","id":1520415,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very lucky, wouldn't you say my dear?&quot; Said Arjuani to Trish in French, as they saw the car following them crash into another vehicle and spin out.<br /> <br /> Trish stiffened slightly at the word &quot;<i>chance&quot;. <br /> <br /> ...</i><br /> <br /> As the car went down the side street, Trish began trying to comfort the little girl. She started to softly sing a little song in what Gilad supposed to be her native language, whatever that could be. Rahel began to calm and the car started to warm up a little bit.<br /> <br /> Jorunn pulled up to the train station.<br /> <br /> &quot;Quickly. We haven't much time&quot;, Arjuani said to Gilad and Trish. The clock on the dashboard indicated that it was near One o'clock.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> As they approached the train platform, Rahel's pale form seemed to brighten for a moment. She squeezed Trish's hand without it phasing, and then ran to two ghosts near the train. They were dressed in old fashioned clothes as well. They wore yellow stars on their coats. <br /> <br /> &quot;Something is off. I've never seen the parents before. This is different.&quot; Said Arjuani. The spectral family boarded the train and as it left the station there seemed to be a bright light in the tunnel. &quot;Mon Dieu! What has happened?&quot; He said.<br /> <br /> Trish looked at Gilad. There were tears in her eyes. <br /> <br /> &quot;My cat died yesterday. Michi. He was grey and liked to chase spiders. And I was so sad. But now that doesn't seem to matter. I'm not sure what just happened. But I feel happier knowing we helped somehow.&quot;<br /> <br /> Arjuani looked back at Trish and Gilad.<br /> <br /> &quot;The City always changes. But it is always itself. Let's go before we are spotted,&quot; he said eyeing the cameras in the ceiling of the station.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-19T13:25:50-07:00","id":1520971,"title":"","content":"<b>Tristan da Cunha: Isla</b>\u200b<br /> <br /> A brown seal came up on shore. It was a small island, less than a hundred square meters. It was mostly rock with a few bits of moss and grass growing. The seal began to wriggle her long body until it began to change form, the torso and hind flippers slowly turning into human legs and feet and the fore flippers stretching out in to arms. The girl stood up on her legs, parts of her body still covered with fur while her tight dark curls began growing from the top of her head.<br /> <br /> Isla began dragging her father's body on to the shore. When she turned around the MacAedan boy was there. He had come in a boat of some sort it seemed.<br /> <br /> &quot;I told you never to come here without permission,&quot; Isla said coolly, her voice a little hoarse and strange, &quot;This is my family's garden. Outsiders are not supposed to be here. What do you want?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-25T14:27:17-07:00","id":1523148,"title":"","content":"<b>Buenos Aires, Argentina: Casa de Escalera</b><br /> <br /> Harju and Hana are unloading Kipina the electric piano from a rented van while Bancu sets up his drum kit. After Jorunn has set up the mics, Silje is ready to start warming up her voice and do a sound check. She starts wailing in her incomprehensible &quot;spirt language&quot;. Lucas tried to remind her that this is a teen's birthday party and that there are also lots of older relatives and not to do anything to &quot;out there&quot;, but you never know what Silje is going to do. Sleepers...<br /> <br /> Some of the guests have begun to arrive. There are many brightly wrapped presents on a table across the courtyard. Gilad sees one guest over at the present's table depositing a gift in green wrapping paper with polka dots. She is an older woman and walks with a cane that has a bird's head that looks oddly familiar to Gilad.<br /> <br /> She sees Gilad from across the courtyard and smiles and beckons to Gilad with a bonny finger.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 09-25-2023, 05:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-25T17:11:48-07:00","id":1523152,"title":"","content":"Artuir stared at the water fountain in the garden out back. There was a statue of a nude woman with a pitcher in hand. From that pitcher flowed a water column. It appeared motionless and were it not for the ripples that echoed where it met the surface of the fountain Artuir might have thought it a glass sculpture. Artuir glanced around at the people preparing for the party. They seemed quite happy. Why shouldn't they be. They had so much. This was the biggest house he'd ever seen. There was so much food from all over the world. There was so much of everything. It was unsettling.<br /> <br /> He felt that it was wrong for him to be here. Not that they would let him leave. No matter, after tonight, he was gone. He had a quest to attend to after all and he wouldn't be able to fulfill it hanging around here. He'd been watching everyone very closely and he was pretty sure that if he could slip away sometime during tonight's party. Artuir could be quite quiet when the situation called for it and as long as he made it to a decently large crowd of regular folks,sleepers he thought he heard them say, he would be safe. Artuir was pretty sure these people knew more about magic than he did, but they had serious hangups about doing it around people who didn't know about it. He'd figured out that much from his time here. That was his best shot.<br /> <br /> Artuir glanced, to his left. There was a gardener who didn't seem to be gardening. He was just sitting there but Artuir couldn't shake the feeling that his privacy was being invaded. He began to wander away. <i>Doesn't matter one way or another. I know what I have to do and I aim to do it. That's all there is to it</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28046-maroon_mumba","user":"Maroon_Mumba","date":". 09-28-2023, 01:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28046-maroon_mumba","name":"Maroon_Mumba","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28046_1.webp","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-25T20:46:36-07:00","id":1523161,"title":"","content":"Richard adjusted his tie as he kept close to Katab. He was caught between his two selves. As Richard Humphrey, he was quite accustomed to high social events and knew how to handle himself. However, Gawain the Arrow was on assignment and needed to remain vigilant and attentive. It was imperative that he represent his Order well on his first solo assignment.<br /> <br /> &quot;So,&quot; he muttered quietly to his companion, &quot;I think it would be best If I followed your lead tonight.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28057-nickeldan","name":"nickeldan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-28T11:32:57-07:00","id":1523281,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;With a keening wail so powerful, Silje is certain to drive any spirits\u200b away from this party. Ah well, it might add to the mystique of our performance. We are almost done setting up, the acoustics here are surprisingly good. Someone is calling me over, that staff reminds me of the Nachtkrapp\u200b, perhaps she recognized my pin&quot;.</i><br /> <br /> Even amidst a Convocation, it would be bad form for an Arrow to expose Sleepers to the Mysteries. But Gilad had a workaround, he had a pin made in the image of the deer humanoid from his Awakening, the one holding a glass. He had a stylized High Speech rune worked into the background, the rune of investigation, hoping it might either draw the attention of those that new more, or at least make for an interesting conversation starter. <br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Lets hope she speaks Swedish, good thing Bancu is nearby if she does not&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Gilad moves across the courtyard to meet the old woman. His stride becomes more confident, measured, yet it also holds to a cadence. His eyes start looking more focused, and an air of discipline permeated his body language as Erik enters the persona of his Shadow Name.<br /> <br /> &quot;God kv\u00e4ll, I am one of the musicians in Utopia, it is a pleasure to meet you&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-29T12:41:24-07:00","id":1523318,"title":"","content":"The frail looking old woman tried to straighten herself to her full height, which was still small, only about 1.52 m.. She smiled and replied in Swedish with a thick accent of some kind. To Gilad's ears it sounded a little like the men of the south, the Goths.<br /> <br /> &quot;Welcome my young friend. Or should I say old? Tell me, do you know the game of chess? I have been playing a most interesting game recently and I am in need of advise on my next move.&quot;<br /> <br /> A laughing gleam was in her clear, unclouded, blue eyes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-30T14:20:02-07:00","id":1523370,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;So she knows I am from the past, interesting. The staff is a very accurate reproduction as well, maybe the person in my Awakening left some kind of record behind ?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Chess was invented after my time, but I played a bit on tour.&quot; Gilad shifts his gaze to the staff for a moment. &quot;But I believe we are interested in the same game, how may I assist?&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-02T15:05:24-07:00","id":1523476,"title":"","content":"&quot;It is true that it was not well known to sleepers of your time and place. Arab merchants and explorers brought it from India and Persia, where it had been known to those of the Diamond for many centuries. Ahmad ibn Fadlan knew the game and shared it with your country men. I hear rumors that there are some highly skilled warriors who play the game in the high mountains of Alborz.&quot; She chuckled a little to herself.<br /> <br /> &quot;Lucas, your 'stage manager' I think likes the game very much and has played it for longer than you might imagine. Yes, he and Jorunn's father have played many games together over the years.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The goal of chess is to trap the king of course. Sometimes this requires a sacrifice, what is called a gambit. Another tactic is to move a pawn to your opponent's side of the board. When this happens, the pawn may be promoted to a more powerful piece, even a Queen.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I have taken a liking to you, young talon. &quot; She smiled.<br /> <br /> &quot;And I wish to help. There is a young mystagogue and their banner warden here at the party. Americans. They have been invited to help the hierarch...&quot; She said this with a slight sneer of contempt, &quot; with a little problem of his. A book. A book that might be of interest to you.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;In exchange for this information, I ask the favor that you go and befriend a lost and wandering child. He wishes to find others of his kind and has an interest in stories of great warriors of the past. He is easily impressed with great shows of power. He is over in the garden.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I noticed that you did not bring a present for the young Senorita. That would be correct where you come from, but it is not the custom here. Don't worry. You can have one of the presents I brought. I'll say it is from you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-03T18:21:37-07:00","id":1523519,"title":"","content":"<i>Ibn Fadlan brought chess over ? Well he was one of the great travelers, I could see him taking the game with him as a way to entertain hikself on long journeys.<br /> <br /> Highly skilled warriors who play it the mountain of Alborz ? That is definitely a Persian name. Arrows maybe ? Seems to be what is implied, she just mentioned the Awakened. I will ask Lucas about it later.<br /> <br /> So there is a unique book here ? Maybe it has a chronicle from what happened in Olan, maybe it has one of Alruna's prophecies ? I need to have a look at it, and why these other mages are interested.<br /> <br /> Helvete ! The right custom was to bring a gift, well this was a lucky fix.<br /> <br /> But that being said, I cannot forget the original topic. </i><br /> <br /> That is very generous of you, <i>tack</i> ! I will gladly tell him the tales of the past, so that their memory may endure.<br /> <br /> <i>Close one, I almost said &quot;it is my family's trade&quot;. That is Erik's history Gilad, not yours, stay in character.</i><br /> <br /> But before I do, what was this gambit you wanted me to take a look at ? Should I ask Lucas to join us ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-04T15:10:26-07:00","id":1523576,"title":"","content":"She chuckles to herself. Gilad's unseen sense is triggered.<br /> <br /> There is a commotion towards the front of the house and it appears that Amilia and her teen friends have arrived. He spots two Americans, one of whom seems to have brought a rather large sword that he is reluctantly handing over to a servant.<br /> <br /> When Gilad turns back the Lady Rook is no longer there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-04T15:48:23-07:00","id":1523578,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Well, she certainly knows how to make an exit. It seems out American mages have arrived. Hmm, one of them have a claymore, a fine one too, now that costs some strawberries. They have to leave such an important part of their ceremonial robes behind ? We have to leave a fine blade behind, but need to wear a silk noose ? These modern etiquettes rules go over one's dandruff<br /> <br /> It seems time is running short, the young lady just arrived. Right, gift first&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Gilad makes his way towards the gifts, writing his name on the one the old lady pointed him towards. After he finishes, he makes his way to the gardens, in search of the wanderer.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;The old lady certainly has a trick up her sleeve, maybe the gift will cause some confusion. But information on how I ended up in this time is too tempting, its the first lead after a year of searching. I can only hope I met a Loki rather than an Odin.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-05-2023, 10:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}